    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpCreateTitle">Create and select</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpCreateBody" xml:space="preserve">• Click empty space: create a note at the New note length and audition it
• Click a note: select and drag
• Ctrl + click: add to or remove from the selection
• Drag empty space: box-select; Ctrl + box-select: add to the selection
• Ctrl + A: select all; Ctrl + Shift + ← / →: select notes before / after the cursor
• Right-click empty space: clear the selection
• ← / →: move by one snap-grid step; Shift + ← / →: move by one beat
• Ctrl + drag a note: copy
• Delete / Backspace: delete; Ctrl + Z / Ctrl + Y: undo / redo</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpRhythmTitle">Rhythm and duration</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpRhythmBody" xml:space="preserve">• Snap grid controls position steps independently of new-note length
• Drag a note's right edge: resize it using the snap grid
• Right-click a note: precisely set its rhythmic value and key-hold ratio
• [: shorten selected notes; ]: lengthen selected notes
• With no note selected, [ / ] changes the snap grid</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpNavigationTitle">Navigation and audition</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Editor_HelpNavigationBody" xml:space="preserve">• Click or drag the top ruler: set the playback cursor
• Space: play / pause local audition
• Select notes, then enable Loop: audition the selection repeatedly
• Ctrl + wheel: horizontal zoom; Shift + wheel: horizontal scroll
• Ctrl + Shift + wheel: vertical zoom</system:String>
